1
00:00:03,180 --> 00:00:05,420
People of the Aurigan Reach -

2
00:00:05,780 --> 00:00:08,020
I am Kamea Arano,

3
00:00:09,380 --> 00:00:11,020
and I have failed you.

4
00:00:11,780 --> 00:00:13,940
For three long years,

5
00:00:13,980 --> 00:00:16,820
Director Espinosa has imprisoned

6
00:00:17,180 --> 00:00:18,620
and starved

7
00:00:19,380 --> 00:00:21,820
and murdered our people.

8
00:00:22,580 --> 00:00:23,900
And where was I?

9
00:00:24,460 --> 00:00:26,020
Hiding in a palace,

10
00:00:26,500 --> 00:00:28,220
light-years away.

11
00:00:28,580 --> 00:00:30,340
Building support.

12
00:00:31,380 --> 00:00:32,620
<b>Planning</b>.

13
00:00:33,580 --> 00:00:35,620
While The Directorate's secret police

14
00:00:35,620 --> 00:00:37,900
turned neighbor against neighbor,

15
00:00:38,300 --> 00:00:40,420
made your loved ones disappear,

16
00:00:40,860 --> 00:00:43,020
conscripted your children.

17
00:00:44,020 --> 00:00:45,820
I wasn't here.

18
00:00:46,780 --> 00:00:48,100
I didn't know.

19
00:00:49,460 --> 00:00:52,820
The crimes that I have witnessed here today

20
00:00:52,980 --> 00:00:54,620
are unforgivable.

21
00:00:55,060 --> 00:00:57,340
No doubt, Director Espinosa believes

22
00:00:57,380 --> 00:00:59,620
that the ends justify the means.

23
00:00:59,660 --> 00:01:02,620
That the Aurigan Reach has been made "strong."

24
00:01:02,980 --> 00:01:06,700
Well, I say that strength built on fear is brittle.

25
00:01:06,860 --> 00:01:09,140
The Directorate is a paper tiger,

26
00:01:09,220 --> 00:01:11,620
and I declare this Restoration today

27
00:01:11,780 --> 00:01:14,540
to rally the <b>true</b> strength of our people -

28
00:01:14,900 --> 00:01:16,220
Our resilience

29
00:01:16,380 --> 00:01:17,820
and our freedom.

30
00:01:18,180 --> 00:01:22,220
Let Weldry be a call to arms -

31
00:01:22,380 --> 00:01:23,420
join us,

32
00:01:23,460 --> 00:01:25,620
and together we will liberate The Founding Houses

33
00:01:25,620 --> 00:01:27,500
and retake Coromodir.

34
00:01:27,820 --> 00:01:29,980
Not because it is my birthright.

35
00:01:30,300 --> 00:01:33,420
But because The Directorate's crimes against you,

36
00:01:33,420 --> 00:01:35,020
the Aurigan people,

37
00:01:35,020 --> 00:01:38,020
will no longer be tolerated!

38
00:01:38,100 --> 00:01:40,540
THAT is what I fight for -

39
00:01:40,580 --> 00:01:43,140
and I vow to fight for your freedoms

40
00:01:43,180 --> 00:01:45,820
to my dying breath!

